<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>泰百藝人終極挑戰 | Thai GL Quiz</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #ff4d8d;
            --secondary: #8a2be2;
            --bg-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe6f0 0%, #f3e6ff 100%);
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-dark: #2d2d2d;
            --text-muted: #666666;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: var(--bg-gradient);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        .container {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 77, 141, 0.15);
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1 {
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .mode-selector {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .mode-btn {
            background: #f3e6ff;
            color: var(--secondary);
            border: 2px solid transparent;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .mode-btn.active {
            background: var(--secondary);
            color: white;
        }

        .status-bar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #ffe0ec;
            color: var(--primary);
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .question-box {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            min-height: 90px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #fff9fb;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            border: 2px dashed #ffc2d9;
        }

        .options-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .options-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        .option-btn {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 15px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .option-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            background: #fff0f6;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .option-btn.correct {
            background: #d4edda;
            border-color: #28a745;
            color: #155724;
        }

        .option-btn.wrong {
            background: #f8d7da;
            border-color: #dc3545;
            color: #721c24;
        }

        .option-btn:disabled {
            cursor: default;
        }

        .feedback-box {
            min-height: 50px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            padding: 12px 15px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: none;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .feedback-box.show {
            display: block;
            background: #f1f3f5;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 14px 35px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 30px;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 77, 141, 0.3);
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .hidden {
            display: none !important;
        }

        .rank-title {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--secondary);
            margin: 15px 0;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <!-- 開始畫面 -->
    <div id="start-screen">
        <h1>💖 泰百藝人終極挑戰 💖</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">涵蓋 GMMTV 眾多女神與各大熱門泰百 CP，測試你的入坑深度！</p>
        
        <div class="mode-selector">
            <button class="mode-btn active" id="mode-all" onclick="setMode('all')">🌟 全部泰百綜合場</button>
            <button class="mode-btn" id="mode-gmmtv" onclick="setMode('gmmtv')">🏢 GMMTV 專屬場</button>
        </div>

        <div style="text-align: left; background: #f9f9f9; padding: 15px 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">
            <strong>📋 遊戲規則：</strong><br>
            1. 每次挑戰隨機抽取 <strong>10 題</strong>（包含藝人線索、代表作品與 CP 配對）。<br>
            2. 答對一題得 <strong>10 分</strong>，連續答對 2 題以上每題額外 <strong>+5 分</strong>連擊獎勵！<br>
            3. 內建 20 題完整題庫（含 MilkLove、NamtanFilm、ViewJune、EmiBonnie、KapookCiize、LingOrm、FreenBecky 等），可重複刷題。
        </div>
        <button class="btn-primary" onclick="startGame()">開始挑戰</button>
    </div>

    <!-- 遊戲畫面 -->
    <div id="quiz-screen" class="hidden">
        <div class="status-bar">
            <span>題數: <span id="question-num">1</span>/10</span>
            <span>連擊: 🔥<span id="streak">0</span></span>
            <span>分數: <span id="score">0</span></span>
        </div>
        
        <span class="badge" id="category-badge">GMMTV 陣容</span>
        
        <div class="question-box" id="question-text">
            題目載入中...
        </div>

        <div class="options-grid" id="options-container"></div>

        <div class="feedback-box" id="feedback-box"></div>

        <button class="btn-primary hidden" id="next-btn" onclick="nextQuestion()">下一題 ➔</button>
    </div>

    <!-- 結算畫面 -->
    <div id="result-screen" class="hidden">
        <h1>🎉 挑戰完成！</h1>
        <p>你的最終得分是</p>
        <div style="font-size: 3rem; font-weight: bold; color: var(--primary);" id="final-score">0</div>
        <div class="rank-title" id="rank-title">泰百資深觀察家</div>
        <p id="rank-desc" style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 25px; line-height: 1.5;"></p>
        <button class="btn-primary" onclick="resetToStart()">返回主畫面 🔄</button>
    </div>
</div>

